# Cortex Core

- Canonical package: `CortexOS/`. `netie` is a backward-compat import alias only.
- Active vertical: **DMS** (`PACK=dms`, `packs/dms/`). Do not modify `packs/ruma/` unless explicitly asked.
- Backend: Python + FastAPI (`CortexOS/api/`). Frontend: Next.js 14 (`demo/dms-ui/`). Analytics: DuckDB.
- Planning docs: `docs/dms/BUILD_PLAN.md`, `docs/dms/VISION_GOVERNANCE.md`, `docs/strategy/NETIE_CORTEX_MASTER_PLAN.md`.
- One feature per agent run. Append to `CHANGELOG_DMS.md` when done. Run `pytest -q` before finishing.
- Smallest diff wins. Do not refactor unrelated code. Existing tests are sacred — add new tests, don't weaken old ones.

## FastAPI gotcha

No `from __future__ import annotations` in FastAPI route modules. Hoist Pydantic models to module level.

